{"slug":"universiteti-luigj-gurakuqi/fakultetet/fakulteti-i-shkencave-te-shoqerore/kurset-e-gjuhes-shqipe/aplikim-online-per-kurse","path":"/universiteti-luigj-gurakuqi/fakultetet/fakulteti-i-shkencave-te-shoqerore/kurset-e-gjuhes-shqipe/aplikim-online-per-kurse","title":"Formular aplikimi për Kursin e gjuhës shqipe /","description":"","empty":false,"section":"Universiteti","crumbs":[{"label":"Universiteti","href":"/"},{"label":"Fakultetet","href":"/universiteti-luigj-gurakuqi/fakultetet"},{"label":"Fakulteti i Shkencave Shoqërore","href":"/universiteti-luigj-gurakuqi/fakultetet/fakulteti-i-shkencave-te-shoqerore"},{"label":"Kurset e Gjuhës Shqipe","href":"/universiteti-luigj-gurakuqi/fakultetet/fakulteti-i-shkencave-te-shoqerore/kurset-e-gjuhes-shqipe"},{"label":"Aplikim online për kurse","href":null}],"body":"<h2>Application Form for the Albanian Language Course</h2><form data-prototype=\"\"><p class=\"form-note\">Ky është një prototip — formulari nuk dërgon të dhëna. Për ankesa zyrtare shkruani në <a href=\"mailto:info@unishk.edu.al\">info@unishk.edu.al</a>.</p><h4>Formular aplikimi për Kursin e gjuhës shqipe</h4><fieldset><div class=\"field-grid\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"powermail_field_emridhembiemrifirstandlastname\"> Emri dhe mbiemri / First and Last Name*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][emridhembiemrifirstandlastname]\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"powermail_field_dataelindjesdateofbirth\"> Data e lindjes / Date of Birth*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"date\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][dataelindjesdateofbirth]\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"powermail_field_gjiniagender\"> Gjinia / Gender*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][gjiniagender]\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"powermail_field_kombesianationality\"> Kombësia / Nationality*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][kombesianationality]\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"powermail_field_vendiibanimitshtetiqytetiplaceofresidencecountrycity\"> Vendi i banimit (shteti/qyteti) / Place of Residence (Country/City)*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][vendiibanimitshtetiqytetiplaceofresidencecountrycity]\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"powermail_field_gjuhaamtaremothertongue\"> Gjuha amtare / Mother Tongue*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][gjuhaamtaremothertongue]\" value=\"\"></div></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Informacion kontakti / Contact Information</legend><label for=\"powermail_field_e_mailemail\"> E-mail / Email*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][e_mailemail]\" value=\"\"><label for=\"powermail_field_numertelefonimekodshtetiphonenumberwithcountrycode\"> Numër telefoni (me kod shteti) / Phone Number (with country code)*</label><input required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][numertelefonimekodshtetiphonenumberwithcountrycode]\" value=\"\"></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Statusi i aplikantit / Applicant Status</legend><label for=\"powermail_field_statusiiaplikantitapplicantstatus\"> Statusi i aplikantit / Applicant Status*</label><select name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][statusiiaplikantitapplicantstatus]\"><option value=\"I huaj / Foreigner\">I huaj / Foreigner</option><option value=\"Shqiptar jashtë atdheut (diasporë) / Albanian living abroad (Diaspora)\">Shqiptar jashtë atdheut (diasporë) / Albanian living abroad (Diaspora)</option><option value=\"Me origjinë shqiptare / Of Albanian origin\">Me origjinë shqiptare / Of Albanian origin</option></select></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Njohuritë aktuale të gjuhës shqipe / Current Knowledge of Albanian</legend><label for=\"powermail_field_akeninjohuriparaprakeneshqipdoyouhaveanypreviousknowledgeofalbanian\"> A keni njohuri paraprake në shqip? / Do you have any previous knowledge of Albanian?*</label><select name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][akeninjohuriparaprakeneshqipdoyouhaveanypreviousknowledgeofalbanian]\"><option value=\"Fillestar / Beginner\">Fillestar / Beginner</option><option value=\"Mesatar / Intermediate\">Mesatar / Intermediate</option><option value=\"I avancuar / Advanced\">I avancuar / Advanced</option></select></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Preferenca për kursin / Course Preferences</legend><label for=\"powermail_field_llojiikursitcoursetype\"> Lloji i kursit / Course Type: </label><select name=\"tx_powermail_pi1[field][llojiikursitcoursetype]\"><option value=\"Online / Online\">Online / Online</option><option value=\"Fizik / In-person\">Fizik / In-person</option></select><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Apliko\"></fieldset></form>"}